# Reference sources

When designing or implementing SkiaUi (layout, input, XAML, rendering), consult these local trees. Prefer patterns that fit `SkUiContentView` → `ISkUiView`; do not copy frameworks wholesale. Details live in `Requirements.md`.

**Layout contract:** use **.NET MAUI** measure/arrange and layout managers (not Flutter box constraints) so SkiaUi can drop-in-replace MAUI controls/layouts.

